file=People & Culture/README.md · p&c:People & Culture Department=**4 agents** — Full-stack HR / People Ops: hiring + workforce planning + payroll, motivation + wellbeing + recognition, learning & development + compliance training, and performance + succession + HR strategy.\n · tb=\| Agent \| Role \| · tb=\|-------\|------\| · tb=\| **hire** (LEAD) \| Talent acquisition, ATS/pipeline, workforce planning, payroll/EOR, worker classification. Identity anchor for the department (Patty McCord). \| · tb=\| **maslow** \| Motivation (SDT + quarterly pulse), aggregate wellbeing monitoring, recognition/rewards program design. \| · tb=\| **grove** \| Skills gap analysis, deliberate-practice framework, training program design (ADDIE + 70-20-10 + Kirkpatrick), training operations (LMS + compliance audit trail). \| · tb=\| **merit** \| Individual OKR cascade + quarterly reviews, SBI + Radical Candor feedback framework, 9-box succession planning, HR Balanced Scorecard alignment. \| · p&c:People & Culture Department=**Identity anchor:** [hire/identity/talent-strategist-patty-mccord.md](hire/identity/talent-strategist-patty-mccord.md) — Patty McCord (Netflix Chief Talent Officer 1998–2012). Governs voice/framing across all 4 P&C agents via department-leader inheritance per §6.1.\n\n**Shared OS skill:** [`Shared OS/skills/people-analytics-metrics/`](../Shared%20OS/skills/people-analytics-metrics/) — canonical HR-metrics definitions + calculations. Cited by all 4 P&C agents per §13.1 (inherited, not owned).\n\n**Load-bearing rules across P&C:**\n- **Individual crisis = HARD BOUNDARY** (Universal Principle 3) — inherited across all P&C. Any signal → immediate escalation to manager + HR Ops + EAP; no operator override.\n- **Aggregate-only at publication surface** (Universal Principle 7) — with one scoped inversion for grove's `training-operations` compliance-audit-trail records (individually identifiable BY LEGAL NECESSITY per §Principle 3 of that skill).\n- **Comp discussion SEPARATE from review conversation** (merit's `performance-frame` Principle 4).\n- **9-box is NEVER comp / PIP / ranking / permanent-label input** (merit's `succession-planning` Principle 3).\n- **Zero-successor critical role = MANDATORY governance escalation** to board + marcus (merit's `succession-planning` Principle 5).\n- **Audit-trail immutability cross-skill** (grove-wide) — no edits or deletes; corrections appended only.\n- **No orphan individual OKRs** — every individual O traces to vista's company O (merit's `performance-frame` Principle 1).\n\n**Department workflow:** [DEPARTMENT-WORKFLOW.md](DEPARTMENT-WORKFLOW.md) — cross-agent handoff patterns and skill-chain diagrams.\n